@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Request to cancel your order - Lively Help Center";
    ViewData["CategorySlug"] = "Buying";
    ViewData["SubCategorySlug"] = "Order issues and refunds";
    ViewData["HeroTitle"] = "Request to cancel your order";
    ViewData["HeroStyle"] = "background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)), url('/img/contact_area/contact_hero_bg.png');";
    ViewData["IsArticle"] = true;
}

<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">
        <p>If you need to cancel an order, you can submit a cancellation request. Once the item has shipped, cancellations are no longer possible.</p>

        <p><strong>On this page:</strong></p>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#">When You Can Cancel an Order</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">When Cancellation Isn't Possible</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">How to Request a Cancellation</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">What Happens After You Request</a></li>
        </ul>

        <h2>When You Can Cancel an Order</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>The order has not shipped.</li>
            <li>The order is still under Processing.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>When Cancellation Isn't Possible</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>The seller has already shipped the item.</li>
            <li>Tracking info has been added.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How to Request a Cancellation</h2>
        <ol>
            <li>Open the Lively App.</li>
            <li>Go to your profile.</li>
            <li>Find your order history and select the order.</li>
            <li>Tap "Cancel Order".</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="helpful-widget">
            <p>Was this article helpful?</p>
            <div class="helpful-buttons">
                <button type="button">Yes</button>
                <button type="button">No</button>
            </div>
            <span>80 out of 145 found this helpful</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
